over this weekend we surpassed a  major coveted vaccination milestone  and we came very close to surpassing  another  on saturday the u.s injected 2.9  million vaccines into people's arms  almost half a million more than the  previous single day record of about 2.4  million vaccines in a day  and we are just shy of three million  vaccines a day  that is a real possibility in the three  days this past weekend friday saturday  sunday  more than 7.7 million vaccines were  injected in just  three days these are the types of  numbers that will turn the pandemic  around if they can be sustained  look at how quickly this has ramped up  when donald trump left office  the seven day average of vaccinations  was  890 000 a day thanks to joe biden  working with pfizer and moderna to ramp  up supply to states and getting the  vaccine to states importantly  because we had this situation under  trump where pfizer and moderna were  reporting deliveries  and yet hospitals and clinics were  saying we don't have the vaccines  so that has been improved we now have  the addition of a third vaccine we may  have a fourth vaccine  we are now averaging 2.16 million doses  per day over the last week  we have a new high water mark of 2.9  million vaccines in a single day  right now by percentage the leading  states on vaccination are new mexico  alaska connecticut  the dakotas rhode island and  massachusetts  states doing the worst on vaccination  percentage-wise  are georgia washington dc which isn't a  state  um alabama texas utah and tennessee  i believe that in the next week possibly  saturday that seems to be the big  vaccination day every week  we will get to 3 million vaccines in a  single day  and if you can make that steady you are  dramatically improving the timeline  on herd immunity compared to just doing  a million vaccines a day you're  you are moving it up uh in fact by  two-thirds  um the math of this is that if  we can accelerate to about three million  doses per day we are looking at maybe  three months  until we start getting into the range of  what we would consider to be herd  immunity  um could be could be three could be four  it could be two and a half  you know if we get to four million doses  a day we could really get even closer  it's not worth calculating it with too  much precision there's no sense in  saying  may 10th will be the day does it you  know that things change and shift  but when you think about three and a  half million a day  that's 210 million doses in 60 days  if you assume 80 of those are the two  shot regimen  and the rest are the one shot you're  maybe looking at fully vaccinating 125  million people in the next two months  30 million are already vaccinated and  then that means that like maybe one more  month  you know 90 days from now we are  starting to get into the range  of herd immunity now there's tons of  work to be done we're racing  against variants against which the  vaccines are not quite as effective in  terms of preventing illness preventing  disease altogether but very effective at  preventing serious disease disease and  hospitalization and death  so there's there's still a lot going on  here and in the next couple of days the  cdc will put out  new guidelines for vaccinated people i  expect  that reading that will encourage more  people to want the vaccine it's  anticipated the cdc will say it's fine  for vaccinated people to gather indoors  in small groups with no masks  i i my thought is that as people start  to see these vaccines actually do have  an  impact on not only the nationwide  numbers but what you can do  that more and more people are going to  want the vaccine and as soon as the cdc  puts out those guidelines we will have  them for you  a very exciting on march 26th  we are going to be doing our next single  day membership special we haven't done  one of these for months  i wish i could tell you there was some  really exciting reason why we're doing  it  the reason we're doing it is february  was the worst month in more than a year  from the standpoint of memberships  the economic situation has led to a lot  of people having to cancel memberships  february being only 28 days  left literally fewer days for people to  sign up february was  a disastrous month for us as far as  memberships go so we are going to have  a one-day huge membership blowout  friday march 26th if you want to be  notified about this membership special  just get on my mailing list at  davidpakman.com real easy  and then a friday morning march 26th you  will get a perfect email  with a spectacular coupon code telling  you exactly how to  sign up at what is close to an illegal  discount it's certainly an immoral  discount  it may even be illegal in some states  but don't worry  nobody's going after anybody for this  stuff so get on the newsletter mailing  list at davidpakman.com  let me know your thoughts on vaccination  and how it's going you can find me  on twitter at deepakman the more we  learn  about various diets around the world the  more we realize  that some of the healthiest diets where  folks are living the healthiest and the  longest  are heavily plant-based and one of our  sponsors  just egg is a great place to start just  egg  cooks and tastes just like real eggs  but it's made from plants it has less  saturated fat  no cholesterol packed with protein i've  been cooking with just  egg at home and you can use it  in so many different ways just like  traditional eggs omelets scrambled eggs  french toast  banana bread one of my favorite dishes  pad thai  it also is better for the planet  generating 93  fewer carbon emissions and 98  less water than conventional eggs  you can find just egg at lots of grocery  stores  whole foods kroger amazon prime  now and instacart check it out just egg  really is a great product from a company  with a great mission  and i'm really glad that they're a  sponsor of the show
 

